# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# Fixed 60-second stress render: useful for comparative host audio studies.
# Load STRESS with SEL+REC; warm up effect tails and Shimmer for 12 s.
# Hardware CPU0/CPU1 deadlines must be tested separately on actual FM-1.
notips
master 2458
press SEL
tap REC
release SEL
expect par112 50
expect ghostmode 14
expect seqcount 1
tap PLAY
wait 12000
wav stress-60s.wav
wait 60000
wavstop
